sequenceDiagram
    participant Dev as Developer
    participant Git as Source Repo
    participant CP as CodePipeline
    participant CB as CodeBuild
    participant CD as CodeDeploy
    
    Dev->>Git: Push code commit
    Git->>CP: Trigger (EventBridge/Webhook)
    CP->>CP: Stage 1: Source
    CP->>CB: Stage 2: Trigger Build
    CB->>CB: Compile & Run Tests
    CB->>CP: Output Artifacts (ZIP)
    CP->>CD: Stage 3: Trigger Deploy
    CD->>CD: Deploy to EC2/ECS/Lambda
    CD->>CP: Deployment Status
    CP->>Dev: Notifications (SNS/Chatbot)
